> @mingfeima This PR enables the XPU staging-buffer path, but the only e2e test that exercises it is still disabled because it depends on upstream NIXL/UCX support ([ai-dynamo/nixl#1536](https://github.com/ai-dynamo/nixl/pull/1536), [openucx/ucx#11218](https://github.com/openucx/ucx/pull/11218)). Local validation is useful, but for an XPU enablement PR we need a clear merge gate: either enable and rerun this coverage once those dependencies are available in CI, or keep the runtime path gated until the test can run.

 @yanbing-j 
i have added 2 e2e test with Mooncake backend these tests are part of nightly test suite. currently for XPU we don't have configuration in CI merge gate with 2 or 3 cards.
